From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:04:48 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 173/202] Meridian: Restart to update shows what's new first;
 after an update, the changelog

The sidebar's pill and Settings' Restart to Update open a sheet with the
release's notes (GitHub's, Markdown), Full changelog, Later and Restart now.
The first window after an update opens the public changelog at the new
version's entry (not on a new install; tests set its address with
--meridian-test-changelog-url).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
